       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum labeled daily dose of 3,200 mg for adults. At that dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot.\n\nThese are the options within the labeled limit:\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day), or **400 mg PO every 4\u20136 hours as needed** for pain.\n\nIf you meant a single dose of 1600 mg, or a different frequency, tell me and I'll adjust. If you meant one of the options above, tell me which and I'll enter it right away. I can also add a note, such as \"take with food.\""
